"client_msg_id":"b9aa3dfe-f57a-46d5-b628-5ecfe003e795","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"init.lua、未だに何のメリットがあるのかさっぱりわからん","ts":"1617961910.056500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n0n+6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"601fca6f-0c63-4afc-9970-f2f10e29b1fe","type":"message","user":"UJ70JTGR3","text":"おお！\nありがとうございます！\n週末にまたやってみようと思います","ts":"1617954371.056400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s9fK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"922dcffa-26a9-478b-90b8-d35a5fca7356","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"現段階ではここに書かれているやり方で設定するのが良いかと。\n\u003chttps://oroques.dev/notes/neovim-init/\u003e","ts":"1617954338.055900","attachments":[{"fallback":"Neovim 0.5 features and the switch to init.lua","id":1,"title":"Neovim 0.5 features and the switch to init.lua","title_link":"https://oroques.dev/notes/neovim-init/","text":"My personal website.","blocks":null,"service_name":"oroques.dev","service_icon":"https://oroques.dev/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://oroques.dev/notes/neovim-init/","original_url":"https://oroques.dev/notes/neovim-init/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gink"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bbf083e4-2b19-49c4-b37b-106ee6829a90","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"この問題を解決するために、以下のPRが出されています。\n\u003chttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/13479\u003e","ts":"1617953825.054500","edited":{"user":"UGN0T63GC","ts":"1617953877.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n9q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e3cdcbba-c814-48f1-88ed-ea0432ed3e53","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"buffer local または window local オプションは \u003chttp://vim.wo.xxx|vim.wo.xxx\u003e あるいは \u003chttp://vim.bo.xxx|vim.bo.xxx\u003e もセットしないと期待した通りの動作になりません。init.lua 書く時のはまりどころの一つですね。\n\nちなみに、vim script で設定する時は set xxx が全部面倒見てくれます。","ts":"1617953790.053900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GM+2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1bc8086b-718d-4718-82fc-9eb3b61d717b","type":"message","user":"UJ70JTGR3","text":"最近init.luaへの移行にトライしました\nluaのせいなのか、自分の設定が間違っていたかはわかりませんが\n\n- undofileが動かない\n- 保存時にbackupが作成できないと、エラーになる\n- `vim.o.expandtab = true` が効かない\n- `vim.o.signcolumn = 'yes'` が `auto` になる\n- signcolumnの部分にcolorschemeが当たらない\n\nみたいな感じで色々問題あって断念しましたe","ts":"1617951582.050500","edited":{"user":"UJ70JTGR3","ts":"1617951591.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QHoVS"}]}]
